# Git Commits

When creating commits for any repository:

- **NEVER** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any AI/agent/tool co-author trailer (Cursor, Copilot, Claude, Gemini, Antigravity, etc.) to the commit message subject or body.
- Write only the project's commit message in **English** — concise, clear, focused on **why**, and following existing repository style.
- Do not append tool or agent attribution lines unless the user explicitly asks for them.
